# Golden: the clip launch primitive (Phase-5 Item #2, docs/design/
# clip-primitive-design.md). Exercises all three content kinds' registration
# (clip add), an immediate stop on a step-track clip BEFORE the transport
# starts (so its step never sounds), a next-bar-quantized launch of a
# style-section clip (lands with the bar boundary), a bad clip id (warns,
# does not crash), and an immediate re-launch of the step-track clip.
port open out synth
track new lead synth:1
track length lead 4
track step lead 1 C4 100 240
clip add lead 0 track 0
style load basic
style route drums synth:10
style route bass synth:2
style route chord1 synth:3
play C
clip add bass 0 style varB
stop clip 0
transport start
launch clip 1 quantize 1
launch clip 99 quantize 0
advance 3840
launch clip 0 quantize 0
advance 960
quit
